Terms.s7Body:
You agree not to:

- share, resell or provide access to your account, or create multiple or automated accounts, or abuse the free-trial system;
- copy, scrape, bulk-download, redistribute, or create derivative products from our content (questions, study chapters, model answers, summaries) except for your own personal exam preparation;
- reverse-engineer, probe, overload, or attempt to bypass usage limits, security, or access controls of the Service;
- submit unlawful content, or use the AI features to generate abusive, infringing, or unlawful material, or to attempt to extract training data or manipulate the models;
- in the community features, post content that is abusive, harassing, hateful, defamatory, spam, sexually explicit, that infringes others' rights, or that shares another person's private information. Community posts are screened and may be moderated or removed, and accounts that violate these rules may be suspended.

Refund.s4Body:
We will refund your payment where:

- you were charged but Pro access was not granted (for example, a payment succeeded but activation failed);
- you were charged more than once for the same purchase, or charged in error;
- the wrong plan was provisioned after your payment; or
- a verified technical failure on our side prevented you from using the Service for a significant part of your paid term and we are unable to resolve it.

In these cases we refund the affected amount (or a fair pro-rata amount for a verified service failure) to your original payment method.
